cff-version: 1.2.0
version: 3.0.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived data, please cite it as below."
title: "TCCounts: enumerating the specification space of western North Pacific and Philippine Area of Responsibility tropical cyclone count trends"
abstract: >-
  Recomputes tropical cyclone counts from the IBTrACS v04r01 western North
  Pacific archive for the basin and for the PAGASA Philippine Area of
  Responsibility hexagon, fits a linear trend under every combination of six
  grading requirements, four counting rules and fifty start years, and traces
  the resulting disagreement to growth in the share of storms each operational
  agency graded across the record.
authors:
